{
  "slug": "private-credit",
  "name": "Private Credit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Domain-specific skills and commands for private credit analysts and portfolio managers at direct lending funds. Covers covenant compliance, EBITDA adjustments, IC memo generation, quarterly monitoring, deal screening, credit modeling, amendment analysis, and scenario testing.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **6 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `borrower-monitoring`, `covenant-compliance`, `credit-memo-standards`, `credit-model-standards`, `ebitda-addback-treatment`, `quarterly-package-extraction`\n- **Commands** (6): `amendment-summary` (Structured summary of every change in a credit amendment), `cim-screen` (Screen a CIM or teaser for credit fit: Pass / Pursue / More Info), `covenant-check` (Full covenant compliance snapshot with headroom analysis), `ic-memo` (Generate a full IC memo from deal inputs (CIM + model + term sheet)), `quarterly-review` (Produce covenant table, variance summary, and management questions from quarterly package), `scenario-analysis` (Base / Downside / Stress case comparison with covenant breach flagging)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install private-credit@claude-community` from `KD-alt20/private-credit-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
